.TH WERKMEISTER-FEATURE-LOGS 1 "" "werkmeister" "Werkmeister Manual"
.SH NAME
werkmeister\-feature\-logs \- Tail a feature's container logs
.SH SYNOPSIS
\fBwerkmeister feature logs\fR <feature> [service]
.SH DESCRIPTION
.PP
Streams logs in real\-time (equivalent to \fBdocker compose logs \-f \-\-tail 100\fR). Press \fBCtrl+C\fR to stop.
.PP
.nf
.RS 4
# All services
werkmeister feature logs my\-feature

# Just frontend
werkmeister feature logs my\-feature frontend
.RE
.fi
.SH SEE ALSO
\fBwerkmeister\fR(1)
